ALTER TYPE evolution_action ADD VALUE 'activate';

COMMENT ON TYPE evolution_action IS 'How a strategy''s status came to change. retire, mutate and promote are the evolution loop''s own verbs. activate is the owner''s: a candidate made active by decision rather than by a holdout win. It exists because the loop was found to be circular — it needs two active strategies clearing 10 closed trades in 30 days before it will rank anything, candidates can only be woken by a promote row, and only the loop can write one, so the two dormant seeds that would have supplied the second qualifier could never be reached. Owner activation is the second legitimate path into active, and it is a logged decision for the same reason a promote is: reconcileFirability reads these rows to decide whether a candidate was meant to be active, and a status set with no row behind it is indistinguishable from a mistake.';
